        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/8d06ec5a5b404ec981380a3d955e9742.avif?t=1764752993\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Legacy, you play as a young woman in 2022, determined to unravel the <strong>mystery</strong> of her family’s <strong>dark</strong> past. Her journey leads her to uncover the truth behind her grandfather's <strong>disappearance</strong> and death during the reign of the &quot;Mighty Ones.&quot; With the help of a former prisoner from the 1960s, she embarks on an unsettling adventure through eerie locations where the past and present collide, revealing the <strong>secrets</strong> of the Dark Times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a journey filled with <strong>stealth</strong> and <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, you'll encounter threats and obstacles guarding the truth. Every clue brings you closer to uncovering your family's hidden legacy—and the horrors the Mighty Ones fought to silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/cc3b0590ad05cc3dd730e604d9062d32.poster.avif?t=1764752993\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/cc3b0590ad05cc3dd730e604d9062d32.webm?t=1764752993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play in two time periods: 2022 and 1964. In 2022, you'll have more <strong>exploratory</strong> gameplay and <strong>historical resource</strong> gathering, playing as Melina. In 1964, you'll have two playable characters, which you'll choose at the beginning of the game as Melina. However, 1964's gameplay focuses more on <strong>puzzle-solving and stealth</strong> in a darker atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/3f058a1b95319c0ca142555bbe91e063.poster.avif?t=1764752993\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/3f058a1b95319c0ca142555bbe91e063.webm?t=1764752993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical context:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some information in the game comes from <strong>historical research on events in Brazil</strong> in 1964. A <strong>historian</strong> was hired to contribute to Legado's development. The prison is a real place located in the state of <strong>Rio Grande do Sul</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/8d06ec5a5b404ec981380a3d955e9742.avif?t=1764752993\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Legacy, you play as a young woman in 2022, determined to unravel the <strong>mystery</strong> of her family’s <strong>dark</strong> past. Her journey leads her to uncover the truth behind her grandfather's <strong>disappearance</strong> and death during the reign of the &quot;Mighty Ones.&quot; With the help of a former prisoner from the 1960s, she embarks on an unsettling adventure through eerie locations where the past and present collide, revealing the <strong>secrets</strong> of the Dark Times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a journey filled with <strong>stealth</strong> and <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, you'll encounter threats and obstacles guarding the truth. Every clue brings you closer to uncovering your family's hidden legacy—and the horrors the Mighty Ones fought to silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/cc3b0590ad05cc3dd730e604d9062d32.poster.avif?t=1764752993\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/cc3b0590ad05cc3dd730e604d9062d32.webm?t=1764752993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play in two time periods: 2022 and 1964. In 2022, you'll have more <strong>exploratory</strong> gameplay and <strong>historical resource</strong> gathering, playing as Melina. In 1964, you'll have two playable characters, which you'll choose at the beginning of the game as Melina. However, 1964's gameplay focuses more on <strong>puzzle-solving and stealth</strong> in a darker atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/3f058a1b95319c0ca142555bbe91e063.poster.avif?t=1764752993\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019610/extras/3f058a1b95319c0ca142555bbe91e063.webm?t=1764752993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical context:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some information in the game comes from <strong>historical research on events in Brazil</strong> in 1964. A <strong>historian</strong> was hired to contribute to Legado's development. The prison is a real place located in the state of <strong>Rio Grande do Sul</strong>.</p>",
